            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu bweyamala okutegeera nga Musengwa amwendeza kusabira Baisiraeli nkabi, yaaloba kuja kwebuuzaaku nga bweyakola ku mikuzi gire egindi. Aye yaalingiriza bwa maiso ge eri eirungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaabona Abaisiraeli nga basimbye weema dhaibwe, ng'ebika byaibwe bwe biiraganwaku. Agho omwoyo gwa Katonda gwamwidhaku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaayogera ebibono eby'obulanzi bino, ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Balaki yaasungughalira inho Balaamu, era yaakuba mu ngalo bukiika, ng'amukoba ati: “Nakwese oidhe okolimire abazigu bange, aye bona obasabire bwa nkabi emikuzi gino esatu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, mperaano lumuka oireyo ewuwo. Nali nkusuubiiza okukuleetera okuba ow'ekitiibwa, aye Musengwa Katonda akulemeisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu yaidhusa Balaki ati: “Tyakobera bakwenda be wantumira nti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Waire Balaki ampa endhu ye ng'eidhwire feeza ni zaabu, tighanga kuva ku kiragiro kya Musengwa Katonda, ni nkola kyange ku bwange, ka kibe ekirungi oba ekibi? Era nti, Musengwa ky'anankoba kyonka kye ndidha okwogera?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano ndi kwirayo mu bantu bange. Aye bona eno, ka nkukobere abantu abo Abaisiraeli kye balikola abantu bo mu biseera eby'oluvainhuma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaayogera ebibono eby'obulanzi bino, ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
